## Context
`~/.claude/skills` holds five symlinks whose targets no longer exist: arena, dream, healthcheck, index-source, zotero-import (the last was renamed zotero). Observed 2026-10-20 on doudou; cause not yet established (projection does not prune links to removed skills, or the links predate the removal).

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Cause identified (`scripts/adapter-claude-code-activate.sh`, `adapters/lifecycle.py`)
- [ ] Activation removes links into `.agents/skills/` whose target is gone, and reports them
- [ ] A test builds a dangling link and sees it pruned; a live link and a foreign link are left alone
- [ ] The five links are gone on doudou and the check is run on padme
